      "id": "2p2z",
      "label": "2p2z",
      "about": "The Bode window's default design: crossover 3 kHz, two zeros at 1 kHz, below the LC resonance (1.4–1.9 kHz, from the inductor seen through D'), pole at 40 kHz, matched to z. Phase margin 38–43° over the operating range, gain margin 11 dB. The right-half-plane zero (20 kHz at 2 A, 13 kHz at 3 A) keeps the crossover low.",
