      "about": "Crossover 10 kHz, zeros at 1.5 kHz, pole at 20 kHz: beyond the frequency where the right-half-plane zero and the delay use up the phase. Phase margin −17° at 12 V and 2 A, down to −38° at 9 V and 3 A. The loop oscillates before any step, and the output's average sits below the reference.",
